# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@keyframes fade-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  @at-root (without: all) {
    .fade-in {
      animation: fade-in 200ms ease !important;
    }
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }
}

```

# Diagnostics
```
parity-keyframe-at-root.invalid.scss:12:16 lint/suspicious/noImportantInKeyframe ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Unexpected !important within a keyframes declaration.
  
    10 │   }
    11 │   to {
  > 12 │     opacity: 1 !important;
       │                ^^^^^^^^^^
    13 │   }
    14 │ }
  
  i Declarations marked !important inside keyframes are completely ignored in some browsers, so they have no effect there.
  
  i Remove the !important annotation and keep the declaration.
  

```
